# Send only files used by Dockerfile to the builder. This prevents local media,
# cookies, rclone credentials, SQLite state, and logs entering the build context.
*
!LICENSE
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!gamdl_cn/
!gamdl_cn/**

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pyd
**/*.so
gamdl_cn/downloader/ammuxer/target/
